Performs a basic startup configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
[1] \fBsetup\fR

.SH DESCRIPTION
This command performs a basic startup configuration by:

\(bu Phase 1: Asking you relevant questions to set up your basic network configuration.

\(bu Phase 2: Executing online commands using your inputs.

\(bu Phase 3: Applying the configuration using the \fBapply\fR command.

This command is automatically executed when you first connect to the system.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR apply (1),
.BR ip (1),
